\f0\b\fs42\fsmilli21333 \cf2 \strokec2 System overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa293\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 SheetsCRM is a 
\f0\b local-first Next.js 15 application
\f1\b0  that:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Reads
\f1\b0  form intake rows from a Google Sheet (Sheets API), plus optional teammate 
\f0\b cover sheets
\f1\b0 .\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Writes
\f1\b0  selected columns back to that sheet (status, user ID, reso/listing, contact reason, user-emailed flag, admin notes).\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Overlays
\f1\b0  CRM state in a local 
\f0\b SQLite
\f1\b0  database (
\f2\fs25\fsmilli12667 better-sqlite3
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 , WAL mode).\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sends and syncs email
\f1\b0  via the Gmail API using the signed-in Google user\'92s credentials (including unread inbox, multi-thread link, backfill, and CRM-only redaction).\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Reads Calendar and People/Contacts
\f1\b0  for reminders and recipient suggestions.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Computes dashboards
\f1\b0  (personal, service, team, quality/escalation) and can export or email reports.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa293\partightenfactor0
\cf2 There is 
\f0\b no multi-tenant server
\f1\b0 , 
\f0\b no central backend
\f1\b0 , and 
\f0\b no application-level user accounts
\f1\b0 . Each installation is a single Node process on an operator\'92s machine, defaulting to 
\f2\fs25\fsmilli12667 http://localhost:3000
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

